OL,3,GNEWSAStourbridge fires started
OL,4,Aaccidentally
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief Fire Officer Simon Tuhill said so
OL,7,Fmany people had been affected the
OL,8,Fservice wanted to confirm both fires
OL,9,Fwere not started deliberately. They
OL,10,Fwere accidental, he said.
